* This private request supplies both UI entry points. It does not emulate
* physical disk sectors or the disk manager IF38 catalog protocol.
* Compact catalog: private metadata, rendered by the shared menu/CALL CAT.
* Private opcode 11 returns a 32-byte summary and sixteen 32-byte entries.
* It is used by the manager for exact byte lengths and TI attributes.
CATPTR EQU >70C0
CATNUM EQU >70C2
CATFREE EQU >70C4
CATCOUNT EQU >70C6
CATDIR EQU >70C8
CATINDEX EQU >70CA
CATVALUES EQU >70D0

* The compact catalog interface is CALL CAT; no separate IF38 file.
CATALOG B BADOP

* Count unused allocation units from the selected directory scan.
SPACEINFO MOVE 4,G@ZEROS,G@CATFREE
       DST 2,@>8350
       DCLR @>8352
SPACELOOP MOVE 1,G@MARKS(@>50),@>835F
       CZ @>835F
       BR SPACEUSED
       DINC @>8352
SPACEUSED DINC @>8350
       DCH 119,@>8350
       BR SPACELOOP
       MOVE 2,@>8352,G@CATFREE
       MOVE 1,G@NCOUNT,G@CATCOUNT+1
       RTN

DIRECTORY MOVE 2,G@PAB+2,@>8350
       DCH >3DE0,@>8350
       BS NOSPACE
       MOVE 2,@>8350,G@CATPTR
       CALL SPACEINFO
       MOVE 2,G@CATPTR,@>8350
       MOVE 32,G@ZEROS,V*>8350
       MOVE 4,G@HSIGN,V*>8350
       DADD 4,@>8350
       DST 118,V*>8350
       DADD 2,@>8350
       MOVE 2,G@CATFREE,V*>8350
       DADD 2,@>8350
       MOVE 2,G@CATCOUNT,V*>8350
       MOVE 2,G@CATPTR,@>8350
       DADD 32,@>8350
       MOVE 2,@>8350,G@CATPTR
       MOVE 2,G@BEST,@>8350
       DADD 9,@>8350
       MOVE 2,@>8350,G@CATDIR
DIRECTLP MOVE 2,G@CATPTR,@>8354
       MOVE 32,G@ZEROS,V*>8354
       MOVE 2,G@CATDIR,@>8350
       CALL READAUID
       CEQ 255,@>8353
       BS DIRECTNEXT
       CALL AUADDR
       CALL SETHEAD
       CALL GETMETA
       MOVE 2,G@CATPTR,@>8354
       MOVE 24,G@META,V*>8354
DIRECTNEXT MOVE 2,G@CATPTR,@>8350
       DADD 32,@>8350
       MOVE 2,@>8350,G@CATPTR
       MOVE 2,G@CATDIR,@>8350
       DINC @>8350
       MOVE 2,@>8350,G@CATDIR
       MOVE 2,G@BEST,@>8352
       DADD 25,@>8352
       DCEQ @>8352,@>8350
       BR DIRECTLP
       B DONE
